{"ID":"20240515131147-ca0gjn1","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240515131147-ca0gjn1","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240515131147-ca0gjn1\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240515142855-6lxwzg8\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240515142855-6lxwzg8\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:848,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240515142855-6lxwzg8\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:1118,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:1118\u0026#125;","title":"100","type":"doc","updated":"20240515142906"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240515142855-6lxwzg8","Type":"NodeTable","TableAligns":[0],"Properties":{"colgroup":"width: 934px;","id":"20240515142855-6lxwzg8","updated":"20240515142906"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableHead","Data":"thead","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪醫師病案紀錄"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 初診日期：2007/10/01"}]}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"姓名"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"WY"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"性別："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"F"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"年齡及體型"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"43歲，略矮胖"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診日期："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2008/08/18"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診原因："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"病史：腦瘤。2005年手術切除，但2007年1月復發，又切除90﹪腫瘤，但又反覆變大。左半身肢體會麻，時抽筋，有昏倒現象。後背第五椎壓痛，腰部帶脈痛。經期七天，時停時拖幾天，來很準時。服藥後近期左半身肢體麻較過去改善，經前及緊張時麻較明顯。左肩痛時亦有發麻感。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"問診："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"睡眠尚好。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"大便每日一次。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"有一點口渴，喜熱飲。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"胃口好。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"經期準時。（病患有服HT-2退奶丸）"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"雙足溫，手溫額涼。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"脈診："}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"望診舌診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"淡白紅。"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"特殊診斷："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"第五椎壓痛減少。"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"診斷："}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"中藥處方："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2008/05/28處方繼續再服。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"解說："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"本病患居住於香港，自初診至今共就診四次，分別為2007/10/01、2007/10/03、2008/05/28及2008/08/18。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"倪師指出，女性之腦瘤成因，乃由於心火不足造成奶水逆流入腦而成，故若能使奶水正常轉化為月經而排出，腫瘤細胞在無法持續得到養分的情況下就會慢慢縮小。因此本病患治療的重點在於通便、強心、治月經。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"初診、二診處方："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"(1)噴鼻粉（麝香礬石散）  一日噴一次"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"(2)茯苓五錢 桂枝三錢 炙甘草三錢 大棗 十枚 小麥五錢"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"艾葉二錢 當歸二錢 川芎三錢 熟地二錢 白芍三錢"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"龍骨三錢 牡蠣一兩 生附子二錢（另包）"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"12帖，"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"9碗水煮成3碗，"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"早晚餐前各服1碗"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"(3)多服蔗糖水以緩和抽筋。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"方義：麝香礬石散能使腦部因腫瘤而產生的水腫消退，使積水從鼻竅流出，以阻斷腫瘤之水源。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"苓桂甘棗湯治帶脈痛。甘麥大棗湯可治療抽筋，芎歸膠艾湯去阿膠以調理月經。龍骨牡蠣潛陽，牡蠣亦能軟堅。生附子強心陽，去裡寒。（以上說明及當時相關問診內容尚可參FTP站中「倪師臨床醫案4」講義夾中W君BRAIN TUMOR.doc）"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2008/05/28回診病情有較和緩，第五椎壓痛比上次輕很多，左側臉麻在經前加重、經後減輕。倪師以初診原方加入黃耆五錢補氣行氣、勾陳四錢治療頭痛，瓦楞子五錢治療頭部腫瘤。同時讓病患在經前一週及經期間服用HT-2（退奶丸），30×2，早晚飯後各服1次。續用噴鼻粉。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"★補充說明：瓦楞子外型既似乳房側面，也像頭部，可用於兩種時機。一是乳房腫瘤硬塊合併有傷口流濃時，要加入處方中與牡蠣配合重用，劑量在五錢以上。另一種情況則用於治療頭部腦部之腫瘤。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2008/08/18效不更方，持續服用；但噴鼻粉先停用（病患使用後鼻乾、鼻塞）。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"★補充說明：當病患使用麝香礬石散後，會有鼻水或大量分泌物，要將之擤出咳出不要吞入。一旦開始出現使用後鼻乾、鼻塞時，表示鼻腔、腦部及相關孔竅已經沒有多餘的水分了，藥物僅讓鼻腔產生充血狀態而已，此時就可停止使用。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"備註："}]}]}]}]}